        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "...Sharp, aintcha. All right -- so I'm not Ferny. The name's no matter. Sharkey wants eyes in Bree, see, and a man what wears Ferny's face don't draw questions. Now, no need for unpleasantness. Old Ferny keeps a bit o' coin under a loose board here. Take it, walk away, and ye never saw me."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 2,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
